{
  "info": {
    "name": "PaTodo - Emulador local (API Express)",
    "description": "Flujos de prueba contra la API REST local (Express, puerto 3000) usando los emuladores de Firebase (auth 9099, firestore 8081).\n\nRequisitos: emuladores corriendo (npx firebase emulators:start --only auth,firestore) y la API en api/ (npm start con CORS_ORIGINS y puerto 3000).\n\nOrden recomendado:\n1. 'Registrar usuario (signUp)' crea la cuenta en Auth (emulador).\n2. 'Crear perfil (POST /createUser)' guarda uid en la variable {{uid}}.\n3. 'Publicar trabajo' con el token del cliente.\n4. 'Crear oferta' con el token del trabajador.\n5. 'acceptOffer' → completa el job y crea la reseña (completeJob, createReview).\n\nLa API valida el header Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}. Los endpoints /createUser, /acceptOffer, /completeJob, /cancelJob, /createReview y /computeRoute son exclusivos de la API (antes Cloud Functions); jobs y offers se escriben directo a Firestore REST porque las reglas validan la propiedad (clientId/workerId == tu uid).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "authURL", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:9099" },
    { "key": "fsURL", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1/projects/pa-todo/databases/(default)/documents" },
    { "key": "apiURL", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3000" },
    { "key": "idToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "uid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "offerId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Usuarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario (signUp Auth)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', res.idToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uid', res.localId);",
                  "console.log('idToken y uid guardados:', res.localId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"test1234\",\n  \"returnSecureToken\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authURL}}/identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signUp?key=fake",
              "host": ["{{authURL}}"],
              "path": ["identitytoolkit.googleapis.com", "v1", "accounts:signUp"],
              "query": [{ "key": "key", "value": "fake" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear perfil (POST /createUser)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uid', res.uid || pm.collectionVariables.get('uid'));",
                  "console.log('Perfil creado para uid:', res.uid);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": \"{{uid}}\",\n  \"email\": \"cliente@test.com\",\n  \"role\": \"client\",\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"firstName\": \"Carlos\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Cliente\"\n  },\n  \"contact\": {\n    \"phone\": \"+502 5555-0001\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/createUser", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["createUser"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión (obtener idToken)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('idToken', res.idToken);",
                  "const payload = JSON.parse(atob(res.idToken.split('.')[1]));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('uid', payload.user_id || res.localId);",
                  "console.log('idToken y uid guardados');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cliente@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"test1234\",\n  \"returnSecureToken\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{authURL}}/identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:signInWithPassword?key=fake",
              "host": ["{{authURL}}"],
              "path": ["identitytoolkit.googleapis.com", "v1", "accounts:signInWithPassword"],
              "query": [{ "key": "key", "value": "fake" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Publicar trabajo (Firestore REST)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Publicar trabajo (token cliente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.name) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('jobId', res.name.split('/').pop());",
                  "  console.log('jobId guardado:', res.name.split('/').pop());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"clientId\": { \"stringValue\": \"{{uid}}\" },\n    \"details\": {\n      \"mapValue\": {\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"title\": { \"stringValue\": \"Cambio de llanta\" },\n          \"description\": { \"stringValue\": \"Llanta ponchada en la zona\" },\n          \"categoryId\": { \"stringValue\": \"cat-mecanica\" },\n          \"skillIds\": { \"arrayValue\": { \"values\": [ { \"stringValue\": \"sk-cambio-llantas\" } ] } }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"location\": {\n      \"mapValue\": {\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"geopoint\": {\n            \"mapValue\": {\n              \"fields\": {\n                \"latitude\": { \"doubleValue\": 14.6349 },\n                \"longitude\": { \"doubleValue\": -90.5069 }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"geohash\": { \"stringValue\": \"9fvg4\" },\n          \"address\": { \"stringValue\": \"Zona 10, Guatemala\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"pricing\": {\n      \"mapValue\": {\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"proposedPrice\": { \"doubleValue\": 50 },\n          \"currency\": { \"stringValue\": \"GTQ\" },\n          \"priceType\": { \"stringValue\": \"negotiable\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"status\": { \"stringValue\": \"pending\" }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{fsURL}}/jobs", "host": ["{{fsURL}}"], "path": ["jobs"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Crear oferta (Firestore REST)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear oferta (token trabajador)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.name) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('offerId', res.name.split('/').pop());",
                  "  console.log('offerId guardado:', res.name.split('/').pop());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"jobId\": { \"stringValue\": \"{{jobId}}\" },\n    \"workerId\": { \"stringValue\": \"{{uid}}\" },\n    \"workerSnapshot\": {\n      \"mapValue\": {\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"name\": { \"stringValue\": \"Juan Worker\" },\n          \"rating\": { \"doubleValue\": 4.5 },\n          \"completedJobs\": { \"integerValue\": \"8\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"price\": { \"integerValue\": \"45\" },\n    \"currency\": { \"stringValue\": \"GTQ\" },\n    \"estimatedTime\": { \"integerValue\": \"30\" },\n    \"message\": { \"stringValue\": \"Incluyo materiales\" },\n    \"status\": { \"stringValue\": \"pending\" }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{fsURL}}/offers", "host": ["{{fsURL}}"], "path": ["offers"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. API REST (transacciones)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "acceptOffer",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"jobId\": \"{{jobId}}\",\n  \"offerId\": \"{{offerId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/acceptOffer", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["acceptOffer"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "computeRoute",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"jobId\": \"{{jobId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/computeRoute", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["computeRoute"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "completeJob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"jobId\": \"{{jobId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/completeJob", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["completeJob"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "cancelJob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"jobId\": \"{{jobId}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Ya no lo necesito\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/cancelJob", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["cancelJob"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "createReview",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"jobId\": \"{{jobId}}\",\n  \"rating\": 5,\n  \"comment\": \"Excelente servicio\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{apiURL}}/createReview", "host": ["{{apiURL}}"], "path": ["createReview"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Consultar datos (Firestore REST)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Leer un trabajo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{fsURL}}/jobs/{{jobId}}", "host": ["{{fsURL}}"], "path": ["jobs", "{{jobId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Leer un usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{fsURL}}/users/{{uid}}", "host": ["{{fsURL}}"], "path": ["users", "{{uid}}"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}